    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Improvised_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improvised Weapons\">Improvised Weapons</a> with true skill.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)\">Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You treat all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Improvised_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Improvised Weapons\">Improvised Weapons</a> as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapons\" title=\"Simple Weapons\">Simple Weapons</a>, and you can use them without penalty and with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> designed for use with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapons\" title=\"Simple Weapons\">Simple Weapons</a>. You also deal an additional 1d6 points of damage on a successful hit.</p>",
